WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.307
Tyson and the Three Silly Wishes

00:00:02.957 --> 00:00:05.120
ONE MORNING, AT THE COTTAGE...

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:12.186
“BORING.” “OATMEAL AGAIN?” “I LIKE IT.” “YOU WOULD.” “GO CHECK THE TREASURE TRUNK.” “TREASURE?!”

00:00:13.036 --> 00:00:16.308
“ARR, TREASURE!” “JUST OLD TOYS.” “WAIT.

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:17.707
WHAT IS THAT?”

00:00:18.557 --> 00:00:19.688
3 WISHES.

00:00:19.938 --> 00:00:21.004
BE CAREFUL!

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:25.192
“THREE WISHES?!” “IT SAYS BE CAREFUL.” “IT WINKED!”

00:00:26.042 --> 00:00:32.110
“I WISH FOR...” “...A MOUNTAIN OF DONUTS!” “THAT'S IT?” “IT WORKS!!!”

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:33.877
SOON...

00:00:34.127 --> 00:00:37.308
“BEST DAY EVER!” “KING OF DONUTS!” “OKAY.

00:00:37.558 --> 00:00:38.561
MAYBE...

00:00:38.811 --> 00:00:40.621
TOO MANY.” “UH-OH.”

00:00:41.471 --> 00:00:47.851
“TYSON?!?” “OH MY.” “WHEEE!” “HOW MANY DONUTS?” “A MOUNTAIN.” “I CAN FIX THIS.”

00:00:48.701 --> 00:00:51.914
“I WISH I WAS...” “...SUPER FAST!” “DONE!

00:00:52.164 --> 00:00:53.976
EASY!” UH-OH...

00:00:54.826 --> 00:00:55.846
“CAN'T...

00:00:56.096 --> 00:00:59.825
STOP...!” “TYSON?” “TOO FAST!!!”

00:01:00.675 --> 00:01:04.773
“WHEW.” “WISHES MAKE BIGGER MESSES.” “I KNOW MY LAST WISH.”

00:01:05.623 --> 00:01:12.115
“LAST WISH.” “I WISH THINGS WERE NORMAL...” “...AND WE FIX IT TOGETHER!” “WHOA.”

00:01:12.965 --> 00:01:17.777
“ONLY TWELVE?” “JUST RIGHT.” “BEST WISH YET.” USE WISHES WISELY.

00:01:18.027 --> 00:01:19.345
“THANKS, MONKEY.”

00:01:20.195 --> 00:01:21.176
THE END!

00:01:21.426 --> 00:01:27.286
“JUST ONE LITTLE WISH...” “I WISH FOR ONE DONUT.” “SHANE!!!” OR IS IT...?
